  "body": "Don't Delay your Inspection! Call us Today!\r\n\r\nVersatile Living, Endless Ways to Enjoy It in Half Moon Bay! Welcome to 2 Compass Point Way, a standout residence on one of Half Moon Bay's most sought-after streets, where elevated coastal living meets a home built for living life your way. This four bedroom, two bathroom property has been curated for buyers who want more than just a house. They want options, space, and a lifestyle that flexes around them.\r\n\r\nA Home That Adapts to You\r\n\r\nNo two days need look the same here. The master suite is a genuine retreat, complete with sweeping views and a designer dressing room that feels more boutique than bedroom. The sleek, contemporary kitchen sits at the heart of the home, equally at home hosting a quiet family dinner or a full-scale gathering. Multiple living zones give you room to spread out, work, relax, or entertain, all without stepping on each other's toes.\r\n\r\nSpace to Explore, Inside and Out\r\n\r\nStep outside and the possibilities multiply. Expansive upper and lower decks open up the home to spectacular outlooks, ideal for that first coffee of the day or a slow evening wind-down. Then there's the twist that sets this home apart: a private bar that opens directly onto your own mini driving range. Practice your swing, host friends for a putting competition, or simply enjoy a space that few homes in Half Moon Bay can offer. Whether you're into golf, entertaining, or just want a home with room to move, there's something here for every kind of day.\r\n\r\nZoned for the Long Run\r\n\r\nPositioned within highly sought-after school zones including Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pigeon Mountain Primary School, this address offers a clear education pathway from primary through to college, a real asset for families thinking long term.\r\n\r\nRight in the Middle of it All\r\n\r\nA short stroll takes you to Half Moon Bay Marina, with cafes, restaurants, shops, and direct ferry access to the CBD right on your doorstep. Add the yacht club nearby and a calm coastal backdrop, and you've got a location that delivers both everyday convenience and genuine escape.\r\n\r\nA Rare Opportunity\r\n\r\nThe vendor is genuinely ready to sell, which means there's real room to negotiate on a home that rarely comes to market. If you're after space, variety, excitement, and the potential to spread out and make it your own, don't just take our word for it. Come and see it for yourself.",
